BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Ikaria Xb 1 (1963)
DTSTART:20260108T020000Z
DTEND:20260108T034500Z
DTSTAMP:20260108T020000Z
UID:AOLK9AObLM
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 86 mins (1h26m)\n\nSIFF Movie Club A visionary work 
 of Eastern Bloc science fiction\, this mesmerizing Czechoslovak adaptation
  of a novel by Stanisław Lem melds Cold War ideology and utopian futurism
  into a tour de force of space-age modernism. 4K restoration. Introduced
  by SIFF Cinema Staff Member Lily Rocklage.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/progra
 ms-and-events/siff-movie-club/ikarie-xb-1\n\nEstimated start: 18:15
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 1\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
